#76750
"Before the Gates of Shadybrook"
"Rising up before you to the south are the massive stone gates of the

halfling city of Shadybrook.  Etched into each of the gates is the image

of a delicate white rose on a blood-red shield.  On each side of the

gates a stone watchtower has been erected and from within it you can see

several halflings peering over over the horizon.  Spanning out around you

to the northeast and northwest are the vast rolling hills of the

Shadybrook wilds which go on for miles with no end in sight.  To the

north the worn, wagon-rutted Southern Trade Road journeys off over the

rolling hills of the wilds.

"
"[Terek] Buffalo, Antelope, Bison, Cheetah, red-tailed hawks

[Terek] Wild Horse, Minotaur Lizard, Locust Swarm. Warthog, Wild stags

[Terek] Giant black Widow, Copperhead

"
