#76752
"Intersection of North Main Street and Halfstep Street"
"Spanning out before you to the south, southwest and southeast is the vast

city of Shadybrook.  Large and small white stone houses alike dot the

grassy landscape of the city.  The roads are covered in deep wagon ruts

which cut through the low grass.  The land rises and falls due to the

builders taking no time to flatten the landscape, leaving it as it was

Halfstep Street lies to the east and west of this point, making its lap

around the exterior ring of the city.  To the south North Main Street

plunges deep into the heart of the city.

"
"[Terek] Extras done.

"
