greyish-colored stones.  Larger stones of the same color line the sides

of the walkway as it heads up to the tiny doorways.

"
E
"white lilies red rose bushes"
"Small, ivory-white lilies and bright-red rose bushes have been planted at

around the base of the small cottages to the east and west.  Each of the

flowers is in full bloom and their pleasant aroma fills the air.

