"1 west stone pillars bulding domed ceiling"
"Lying directly off the edge of the road to the west is an impressive

stone building composed of white marble.  Stone pillars, at least

thirteen feet high, line the front of the building and support its

massive dome-shaped roof.

"
E
"1 east archway stone building"
