#76764
"Baker's Way"
"The various smells from the surrounding bakeries and shops fill the air

along the road.  To the north and south large white marble buildings sit

off the edge of the road and occasionally a strong wave of heat emanates

from within them.  To the west Baker's Way continues its course through

the food district of Shadybrook.  Off in the distance to the east you

spot a small, grassy hill rising up in the center of town.

"
