"1 north building low archway"
"Directly to the north stands a large cobblestone building which has been

painted a bright orange color.  Its roof is covered in green thatch from

which a heavy odor of moldy straw emanates.  A low archway marks the only

visible means of entrance into the building and occasionally the scent of

cheese wafts through it, mingling with the scent of moldly hay.

"
E
"1 south building small chimneys"
