#76773
"Inside the Western Gates of Shadybrook"
"Looming before you to the west, like a watchful guardian, are the massive

western gates of the city.  Stone watchtowers flying the battle standards

of the Shadybrook Militia rest atop each side of the gates.  Running away

from the gates to the north and south are the battlements which surround

the city.  Set into the side of the gates is a steel @Wlever@n covered in

flakes of red rust.  To the north and south small stone guard houses

stand; each void of any windows and set with a single steel door which

allows entrance into them.  To the east the city begins to unfold as its

grassy roads begin their journey into it.

"
