#76774
"Ogrim's Specialty Cheeses"
"The air within the enclosed space of the shop is filled with the mingling

scents of the various cheeses.  Long birchwood tables, covered in stacks

of every type of cheese possible, line the walls of the building.  Large

barrels of cream rest against the northern wall along with large bags

labeled 'Spices'.  In the center of the room a large glass display case

houses a few large wheels of the cheese; each covered in green spots.  To

the south a low doorway leads back out onto Baker's Way.

"
