#76785
"Emerald Avenue"
"Looming overhead to the west are the mighty stone walls of the city. 

Long vines drape down the walls and tangle with each other, concealing

most of the stone.  On several sections of the wall a thick green moss

grows which appears to glow with a pale light.  Standing off the path to

the east is the side wall of a small building topped with four chimneys

which bellow out clouds of white, black and grey smoke.  The avenue dips

down a bit to the south as it continues on its course.  To the north it

proceeds to climb at a slight angle up the hill and towards the western

gates of the city.

"
