#76790
"Sugarloaf Street"
"A few small shrubs grow along the southern edge of the road along the

base of the walls but other than that there is nothing else of interest

along this stretch of road.  The only building within view is a small

stone house which sits directly to the north.  The house is void of any

windows and only a small steel door is the visible means of entrance. 

Flying above the house is a small banner bearing the mark of Shadybrook

Militia.  The street continues its east-west stretch through the city.

"
