bedecked in battle armor.  Every detail imaginable has been added to them

right down to the wrinkles in their foreheads to the scars on their arms. 

One of the statues stands out from the rest; it has been carved in the

likeness of a halfling woman in full plate armor grasping a spiked mace

tightly in her hand.

