#76802
"Inside the Eastern Gates of Shadybrook"
"Looming directly to the east are the massive stone gates of Shadybrook. 

Resting atop each side of the gates are small stone watchtowers atop

which the battle standards of the city fly.  Heading away from each

watchtower are the long battlements of the city upon which you catch a

brief glimpse of catapaults poised to fire.  Sitting to the north and

south are small stone guard houses, each with a single steel door marking

the entrance into them.  Next to the southern guard house, set into the

thick white stone of the gates, is a small steel @Wlever@n.  To the west

the grassy roads and avenues of Shadybrook begin their advance throughout

the vast expanse of the city.

"
