with a deep crimson light and pulse and dim as if of their own free will. 

Peering over the runes you notice they are of different sizes and shapes

and each is surrounded by a small ring of clear rubies.

"
E
"statue stone orc"
"This large statue stands about six feet tall and has been carved into the

likeness of an orc grasping a large pike.  Every part of the statue has

been amazingly detailed right down to the orc's bushy eyebrows.  His face

is locked in a look of fear and his mouth is open wide, as if he were

screaming.  The stone which the statue has been carved from is unlike any

you have seen; parts of it are transparent and you can almost see the

orc's armor beneath it.

"
