#76806
"Halfstep Street"
"Large white stone blocks have been piled up along the northern wall of

the city just off the avenue here.  Resting beside the blocks are crates

filled with masonary tools and other stone-working supplies.  All along

the northern battlements you can see the halfling guards pacing back and

forth as they peer out over the wilds, scanning for any signs of a threat. 

Halfstep Street continues to the east and west from here, rising and

falling through the tiny hills.

