#76821
"Wildflower Lane"
"Several grey rocks peak out beneath the thick layer of grass along the

avenue; some the size of a halfling's skull and others the size of a

storm giant's head.  Wagon ruts snake their way between the rocks and a

few lead straight up to them and than continue on their other side. 

Small weeds mingle with various colored flowers along the edge of the

road, each trying to overtake the other.  Wildflower Lane continues to

the north and south, never straying from its course parallel to the thick

city walls.

"
"[Terek] Extras done

"
