#76823
"Loeia's Custom Crafted Armors"
"Dozens of shields, helms and suits of plate armor adorn the walls of this

tiny shop.  The entire southern wall is dedicated to shields, ranging

from small bucklers to ogre-sized tower shields of various colors and

shapes.  Shelves line the western wall of the shop and atop them rest

helms made from every type of material from leather to ivory.  Hanging

from the eastern wall are impressive suits of plate armor sized for a

halfling and larger.  In the center of the room is a simple stone table

on which rest several polishing cloths, glass vials of oil and a hefty

hammer.  To the north an open archway leads back out onto Jezebel Avenue.

"
