#76825
"The Dancing Kobold Inn - Entranceway"
"Large silk tapestries embroidered with the images of green forest

landscapes adorn the stone walls of this small entranceway.  A long,

velvet cushioned bench rests against the southern wall and sitting in

front of it is a glossy maple table on which a ceramic vase with fresh

wildflowers rests.  Off to the north is a small alcove where you can see

a wooden staircase spiraling up to the second floor.  To the west lies a

brightly-lit room filled with tables and chairs.  Set into the eastern

wall is a small oak door which leads out of the inn.

"
