#76829
"Earthen Tunnel"
"This wide tunnel has been cut directly through the hard soil beneath the

city.  Wooden support beams line the edges of the walls trying to keep

the heavy ceiling from caving-in.  Set in between each beam is a torch

which burns with a dull flame which illuminates the tunnel just enough to

see your hand in front of your face.  The air is extremely cold and with

every breath you take you can see it as you exhale.  Set into the eastern

and western walls are small oak doors.  To the north and south the tunnel

continues through the barracks.

"
