"Enlisted Men's Bunkhouse"
"Four wooden bunkbeds line the walls of this small bunkhouse; each covered

in thick wool blankets and soft goose-down pillows.  At the foot of each

bunkbed is a large steel-banded chest with a hefty lock attached to it. 

