"Captain of the Guard's Quarters"
"The large room has been lavishly decorated with large, bright-colored

silk tapestries and elegant furniture.  In the northwest corner of the

room a small bed has been erected, covered in soft, red velvet blankets

and fluffy goose-down pillows.  Against the southern wall are several

large bookcases each filled with old tomes and scrolls.  A large stone

desk sits in the center of room on which rest several old empty wooden

mugs and stacks of papers.  A tapestry hanging on the northern wall

depicts a large battle between an army of heavily-armored halflings and a

band of orcs and goblins.  Set into the eastern wall is a small wooden

door leading out of the room.

