"Weapon's Storage Room"
"Large wooden weapon racks line the walls of this small room, each filled

with various spears, pikes, swords and bows.  In the center of the room

several large open chests rest in which you can see several hundred

crossbow bolts and arrows.  Hanging on the walls just above the weapon

